# Sarek, Federation Ambassador: "draw a card for every five creature types among non-Borg creatures you control" (CR 205.3m).
# Sarek (Vulcan, Advisor) and Phyrexian Walker (Construct, Phyrexian) give four types - not five, so no card is drawn - and
# the Borg Revolutionary (Borg, Rebel) and Bot2's Woodland Druid (Druid, Human) are not Sarek's controller's non-Borg
# creatures: counting either would make six types and draw a card.

